static const char __pyx_k_Anthropic_Messages_API_adapter_f[] = "Anthropic Messages API adapter for Hermes Agent.\n\nTranslates between Hermes's internal OpenAI-style message format and\nAnthropic's Messages API. Follows the same pattern as the codex_responses\nadapter \342\200\224 all provider-specific logic is isolated here.\n\nAuth supports:\n  - Regular API keys (sk-ant-api*) \342\206\222 x-api-key header\n  - OAuth setup-tokens (sk-ant-oat*) \342\206\222 Bearer auth + beta header\n  - Claude Code credentials (~/.claude.json or ~/.claude/.credentials.json) \342\206\222 Bearer auth\n";
